WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
 I did a full set up for a new project with AI and it took me like a lot of

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.780
 hours to get everything planned after planning and did this, did this.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.200
 And I said, yeah, I'm not happy.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.440
 I want to do this, this, and this before we proceed to the next step.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.100
 So after I think three or four hours, we were done planning

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.300
 and that's a lot of time.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:23.500
 So the first thing I did, I asked it to write down a full prompt to

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.300
 explain AI next time, how I want to do the planning exactly in this style.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.360
 So now my second project, I just put in the MD file.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.260
 I say, read this.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.860
 This is how I want to do the planning.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.280
 Okay.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:34.980
 Do we start?

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.180
 And then it just starts interviewing me.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:37.920
 What do we need?

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.080
 Well, how do we do this?

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.440
 And what does this set up?

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.740
 What server are we using?

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.240
 Et cetera.

